This project bundles third-party data so that it rebuilds offline:

f1db, the open Formula 1 database
  https://github.com/f1db/f1db, release v2026.13.0 (f1db-csv.zip)
  Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
  The archive is redistributed unmodified. Every figure shown by the report
  (results, standings, qualifying, sprints, fastest laps, pit stops) derives
  from it.

f1-circuits, Formula 1 circuit geometry
  https://github.com/bacinger/f1-circuits (Tomislav Bacinger), f1-circuits.geojson
  Licence: MIT
  The circuit outlines drawn on the Classic Eleven and Circuit Lab pages are
  projected from this file.

Team logos (assets/logos)
  Trademarks and copyrights belong to the respective Formula 1 teams. They are
  used solely to identify the teams in an analytical, non-commercial report.
  Remove the folder to build the report with generated crests instead.

